# Clock table v1 (see patches/clock_v1/clock_v1.md). Row 10 of the
# module 0 clock table at 0x03079824: fields +4..+27 only (word 0 untouched).
name: clock-v1-row-10
kind: module
module: 0
region: code
address: 0x3079940
gate: build refuses unless the 24 stock bytes at the target equal `expect`;
  the finished image must also pass firmware_patch.validate()
rationale: AAC high: B core/bus -> 144 MHz solver
  target written directly into the row; A fields zeroed so the solver's
  row-1 floor parks A outputs at 96 MHz; PLL word carried over unchanged
  (v1 conservatism, clock_v1.md flag 2). Data-only edit; reversible by
  rebuilding from stock without this patch.
expect: 00c2eb0b80d1f00880d1f008c068780400a3e11100a3e111
replace: 00c2eb0b0000000000000000000000000044950800449508
